Z||000000||KissMySSFiero||11-30-2001||02:07 PM||||well i got it a few weeks ago from a forum memmber.  i got a few pics at home  so i can post them later.  I havent really driven the car much  (20 miles or less) but i love it.  didnt think i would like the automatic.  but its nice.  the only bad thing.  the money i used to get it was supposed to go into my v8 swap.  but i couldnt even start that till after Xmas anyways.  the car is a red formula with 170k miles.  its a clean car but needs a little cosmetic work on the engine.  it has a little paint fade and needs a dash(bad corners) and drivers seat.  and thats just about it.  if i put 500 into the car i could make it just about show quality.  ok now im just rambling.  i still get excited when i see it.  my place is lookin like a car lot.  now two formulas and an S10 pickup.  if i had a garage i would have 2 more that i would be working on or parting out.  Im telling you it is  and addiction.  but im sure you knew that.  <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <BR>88FORMULA<BR>       <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>        <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
