Z||000005||Fformula88||11-30-2001||05:49 PM||||Congrats on getting the new Fiero.<P>A lot of people will dump on an automatic sports car, but there are advantages too.  My 88 Formula is an auto and I love it as much as my fathers 85 SE 2m6 with 4-spd.  The 4-spd is a bit faster, but I find my Formula just as fun to drive.  Maybe GM isn't the best auto company in the world, but you will be hard pressed to find better automatics!  I love GM automatics... they have nearly bullit-proof reliability, offer crisp shifting and seem very willing to downshift.  Even in my Mom's Buick Century!<P>Best advantage to an auto is in bumber to bumper traffic!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Your left foot won't go numb pushing that Fiero clutch to the floor constantly!!<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/formulasig.JPG">           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">    <P>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
